From 208402a5bd62a6ec1fe7065b1b5481a078e64582 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:18:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] keep lifecycle tokenizer verdicts total at nesting
 limits

Catch SubstitutionNestingLimit at boolean guard boundaries as a conservative match and at the background-chat boundary as a structured refusal. Keep low-level iterators raising and internal data-exempt scans typed so scan_gateway_lifecycle preserves the nesting refusal reason.

Proof: all 8 new regression cases fail on baseline and pass patched, including approval detection, terminal prescan, execute_code and fallback scan. 67 lifecycle/direct-consumer files completed across two serial batches: 10608 passed. scripts/check: 20 checks OK. Parallel performance threshold failed under contention; identical test passes serially on base and patch.
---
 cron/lifecycle_guard.py                       | 29 +++++++-
 ...est_lifecycle_guard_nesting_entrypoints.py | 68 +++++++++++++++++++
 tools/terminal_tool_guards.py                 | 10 +++
 3 files changed, 105 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/cron/test_lifecycle_guard_nesting_entrypoints.py

